WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.973
How do I add a new sales rep and set their login details in Field Sales?

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:10.548
In the sidebar, click Sales reps. The Rep management page opens with a list of all your company's reps.

3
00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:15.406
Click the Add rep button at the top of the page, and the Add rep window appears.

4
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:22.828
In the Basic info section, enter the rep's name and mobile number, then choose a username of at least four characters.

5
00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:29.634
Enter a password of at least eight characters, or click Generate and the system will suggest a ready password.

6
00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:38.575
Click Add rep at the bottom of the window. A Rep account created message appears with the username and password. Copy them and hand them to the rep.
